00:04:52.115 --> 00:04:55.056
The bottom-right corner

00:04:55.056 --> 00:04:57.577
over here of the NDC box,

00:04:57.577 --> 00:05:00.135
that's a positive one for X,

00:05:00.135 --> 00:05:03.280
but a negative one for Y.

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:05.920
But on the screen,

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:08.635
we're looking at
the bottom right

00:05:08.635 --> 00:05:11.040
of pixel space.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.220
And my math might be wrong
on this, so I think

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:16.240
Dina might dub me,
dub my voice at this point.

